/.idea
/MagPython/jom/
/MagPython/jom.zip
# libmpdec is downloaded + extracted at build time (see
# download-libmpdec.ps1 / setup_libmpdec in build-common.sh). Pinned
# version lives in MagPython/libmpdec-version.
/MagPython/libmpdec/
# OpenSSL is downloaded + extracted at build time (see
# download-openssl.ps1 / setup_openssl in build-common.sh). Pinned
# version + expected SHA-256 live in MagPython/openssl-version and
# MagPython/openssl-sha256.
/MagPython/openssl/
# zlib is downloaded + extracted at build time (see
# download-zlib.ps1 / setup_zlib in build-common.sh). Pinned
# version + expected SHA-256 live in MagPython/zlib-version and
# MagPython/zlib-sha256.
/MagPython/zlib/
# libffi is downloaded + extracted at build time (see
# download-libffi.ps1 / setup_libffi in build-common.sh). Pinned
# version + expected SHA-256 live in MagPython/libffi-version and
# MagPython/libffi-sha256.
/MagPython/libffi/
# SQLite is downloaded + extracted at build time (see
# download-sqlite.ps1 / setup_sqlite in build-common.sh). Pinned
# version + year + expected SHA-256 live in MagPython/sqlite-version,
# MagPython/sqlite-year and MagPython/sqlite-sha256.
/MagPython/sqlite/
# ncurses is downloaded + extracted at build time on POSIX (see
# setup_ncurses in build-common.sh; no Windows equivalent — the
# Windows artifact ships no curses module). Pinned version + expected
# SHA-256 live in MagPython/ncurses-version and MagPython/ncurses-sha256.
/MagPython/ncurses/
# CPython is downloaded + extracted at build time (see
# download-python.ps1 / setup_python in build-common.sh). Pinned
# version + expected SHA-256 live in MagPython/python-version and
# MagPython/python-sha256.
/MagPython/python/

# Unix build outputs (build-linux.sh / build-macos.sh)
/build-out/
/MagPython-windows-x86.zip
/MagPython-linux-x86_64.zip
/MagPython-macos-arm64.zip
# build-details.sh output (per-platform release-notes fragment).
/MagPython-windows-x86.md
/MagPython-linux-x86_64.md
/MagPython-macos-arm64.md
